WEBVTT

00:00.710 --> 00:02.390
<b>Make me a promise.</b>

00:02.920 --> 00:05.190
<b>That you'll become the next president.</b>

00:06.920 --> 00:08.320
<b>That's impossible.</b>

00:08.320 --> 00:09.910
<b>I could never be president...</b>

00:09.910 --> 00:10.820
<b>Oh?</b>

00:10.820 --> 00:14.700
<b>You just said you won't let me
have my way with Suletta anymore.</b>

00:14.700 --> 00:16.410
<b>Have you given up already?</b>

00:17.430 --> 00:19.240
<b>Damn you!</b>

00:21.230 --> 00:24.460
<b>I'll take over your precious Quiet Zero!</b>

00:25.230 --> 00:26.500
<b>Oh, good.</b>

00:26.990 --> 00:29.000
<b>I'm sure your father will be pleased too.</b>

00:29.000 --> 00:33.520
<b>But you'd better promise me that
you won't involve Suletta any further!</b>

00:33.520 --> 00:34.930
<b>Of course.</b>

00:34.930 --> 00:39.930
<b>But please allow Suletta and Aerial
to take part in one more duel.</b>

00:39.930 --> 00:41.520
<b>One more?</b>

00:41.520 --> 00:43.860
<b>That's right. This will be the last.</b>

00:44.330 --> 00:46.940
<b>After that, you can do
with her as you like.</b>

00:46.940 --> 00:49.110
<b>Still, will that girl...</b>

00:49.110 --> 00:52.620
<b>really give up Aerial so meekly?</b>

02:24.890 --> 02:27.000
<b>Episode 17</b>

02:38.950 --> 02:41.590
<b>G-Good... morning!</b>

02:42.790 --> 02:44.440
<b>Were you waiting all this time?</b>

02:44.440 --> 02:48.810
<b>No! I, uh... just got here.</b>

02:49.960 --> 02:52.780
<b>You're not suspended from school anymore?</b>

02:52.780 --> 02:53.780
<b>No!</b>

02:53.780 --> 02:56.070
<b>Yesterday marked one week.</b>

02:56.070 --> 02:57.660
<b>Yeah?</b>

02:58.390 --> 02:59.350
<b>Well...</b>

03:00.060 --> 03:03.330
<b>I said something weird the other day.</b>

03:03.330 --> 03:04.670
<b>About...</b>

03:04.670 --> 03:05.580
<b>Tell me something.</b>

03:05.580 --> 03:06.580
<b>Yes?</b>

03:06.580 --> 03:10.090
<b>If I asked you to get rid of Aerial,
what would you do?</b>

03:10.090 --> 03:13.010
<b>Huh? I, uh...</b>

03:14.590 --> 03:16.380
<b>I wouldn't do it.</b>

03:16.900 --> 03:18.430
<b>Because Aerial is...</b>

03:18.430 --> 03:21.890
<b>family to me.</b>

03:25.290 --> 03:28.940
<b>Ms. Miorine,
it's almost your birthday, right?</b>

03:28.940 --> 03:30.030
<b>I suppose.</b>

03:30.030 --> 03:31.480
<b>How would you like to celebrate?</b>

03:32.880 --> 03:36.950
<b>My wish list includes
celebrating a friend's birthday.</b>

03:36.950 --> 03:38.150
<b>I want to give it a try...</b>

03:38.880 --> 03:40.330
<b>Plus...</b>

03:40.330 --> 03:43.400
<b>When you turn 17, Ms. Miorine...</b>

03:43.400 --> 03:44.790
<b>We...</b>

03:45.890 --> 03:47.580
<b>I'll think about it.</b>

03:47.580 --> 03:49.500
<b>Benerit Group Front</b>

03:48.730 --> 03:51.170
<b>Because you're negotiating
with the kidnappers,</b>

03:51.170 --> 03:54.680
<b>you now think you're
his successor, Shaddiq Zenelli?</b>

03:54.680 --> 03:56.280
<b>In the upcoming presidential race,</b>

03:56.280 --> 03:59.670
<b>I intend to run on behalf of Grassley.</b>

03:59.670 --> 04:04.800
<b>Which is why I'd like to form
a partnership with Peil Technologies.</b>

04:04.800 --> 04:08.750
<b>You're getting ahead of yourself.
What's in it for us?</b>

04:08.750 --> 04:12.310
<b>I'll support Gundams as a new
core business for the Group.</b>

04:12.310 --> 04:13.900
<b>Gundams?!</b>

04:13.900 --> 04:16.490
<b>I'll transfer GUND-ARM, Inc. to you too.</b>

04:16.490 --> 04:19.660
<b>Since you developed Pharact in secret
violation of the Cathedra Agreement,</b>

04:19.660 --> 04:21.320
<b>this can't be a bad deal for you.</b>

04:21.320 --> 04:24.500
<b>Will we get the Aerial, too?</b>

04:24.500 --> 04:27.990
<b>I'll leave the sales plan to you.
You can enjoy the actual benefits.</b>

04:27.990 --> 04:30.590
<b>And how does Sarius feel about this?</b>

04:30.590 --> 04:33.960
<b>That man would never
accept such an about-face.</b>

04:33.960 --> 04:36.630
<b>The Council won't stay silent either.</b>

04:36.630 --> 04:39.050
<b>I'll bear the brunt of the criticism.</b>

04:39.050 --> 04:42.550
<b>After all,
we're Cathedra's biggest investor.</b>

04:43.030 --> 04:44.470
<b>Besides,</b>

04:44.910 --> 04:47.980
<b>isn't participation in the Gundam business</b>

04:47.980 --> 04:51.400
<b>the thing you most desire?</b>

04:52.000 --> 04:54.270
<b>Sarius won't be back.</b>

04:55.000 --> 04:56.820
<b>Isn't that what you mean?</b>

05:04.550 --> 05:05.640
<b>Ms. Mio--</b>

05:06.510 --> 05:08.080
<b>Mr. Elan?</b>

05:08.080 --> 05:09.700
<b>I have a favor to ask.</b>

05:10.430 --> 05:13.000
<b>You can't come in here!
This is Ms. Miorine's--</b>

05:15.620 --> 05:17.830
<b>Won't you give me Aerial?</b>

05:18.240 --> 05:19.390
<b>Aerial?</b>

05:19.390 --> 05:21.680
<b>Please. You can be my savior.</b>

05:21.680 --> 05:22.560
<b>No!</b>

05:22.560 --> 05:23.380
<b>Why?</b>

05:23.380 --> 05:25.890
<b>You like me, don't you?</b>

05:25.890 --> 05:27.470
<b>In that case...</b>

05:27.470 --> 05:28.740
<b>No!</b>

05:29.660 --> 05:31.640
<b>The way you are now, Mr. Elan...</b>

05:31.640 --> 05:33.650
<b>I don't like you!</b>

05:34.370 --> 05:36.110
<b>Elan this, Elan that...</b>

05:36.110 --> 05:38.940
<b>How irritating.</b>

05:38.940 --> 05:41.320
<b>The man you're thinking of isn't here!</b>

05:42.050 --> 05:43.020
<b>Now...</b>

05:43.020 --> 05:45.650
<b>Hand over Aerial to me, immediate--</b>

05:47.660 --> 05:48.450
<b>Elan!</b>

05:48.980 --> 05:51.010
<b>What are you doing to her?</b>

05:51.780 --> 05:53.790
<b>Look who's here.</b>

05:53.790 --> 05:56.300
<b>It's none other than the runaway prince.</b>

05:56.730 --> 06:00.470
<b>I never could figure you out.</b>

06:00.470 --> 06:02.390
<b>What are you afraid of?</b>

06:02.780 --> 06:06.340
<b>Don't go showing off
just because there's a girl here!</b>

06:12.620 --> 06:13.760
<b>Cut it out.</b>

06:13.760 --> 06:18.190
<b>If you ruin this place,
no apology will get you off the hook.</b>

06:25.380 --> 06:28.950
<b>Th-Thank you very much.</b>

06:31.140 --> 06:32.030
<b>So...</b>

06:32.030 --> 06:35.380
<b>I heard you quit school.</b>

06:35.380 --> 06:39.120
<b>Lauda went behind Dad's back
and held off my withdrawal.</b>

06:39.770 --> 06:41.320
<b>So I was able to re-enroll.</b>

06:42.280 --> 06:45.050
<b>A-About your father...</b>

06:45.050 --> 06:47.880
<b>I am really deeply sorry about his loss!</b>

06:49.830 --> 06:52.970
<b>It's alright. I have a purpose now.</b>

06:52.970 --> 06:54.230
<b>Huh?</b>

06:54.700 --> 06:57.020
<b>I want to rebuild the Jeturk company.</b>

06:57.020 --> 07:00.190
<b>It's the only thing left
that ties me to my father.</b>

07:01.590 --> 07:03.410
<b>Have you heard what's happened to us?</b>

07:03.410 --> 07:04.410
<b>Yes.</b>

07:04.410 --> 07:06.650
<b>At least... I've heard it's bad.</b>

07:07.140 --> 07:10.610
<b>I spoke to Lauda and we decided
I'd take over as president.</b>

07:11.280 --> 07:13.080
<b>The company is on the brink.</b>

07:13.520 --> 07:15.030
<b>It's up to us to do something.</b>

07:15.850 --> 07:17.380
<b>I don't want to lose...</b>

07:17.940 --> 07:20.000
<b>any more of the things precious to me.</b>

07:21.110 --> 07:24.000
<b>Precious... things?</b>

07:24.500 --> 07:28.260
<b>As soon as my re-enrollment is complete,
I'll return to the company.</b>

07:28.260 --> 07:31.270
<b>Before that, I wanted to visit
the school one more time.</b>

07:32.240 --> 07:36.280
<b>I wanted to apologize
to everyone in Jeturk House, too.</b>

07:36.280 --> 07:39.100
<b>Why would you tell this
to someone like me?</b>

07:40.040 --> 07:42.060
<b>"Move forward, gain two."</b>

07:42.840 --> 07:47.160
<b>I... finally understand how frightening
it is to move forward.</b>

07:47.920 --> 07:51.700
<b>It's because I was scared that
I kept running away from my father.</b>

07:52.970 --> 07:54.660
<b>But now I can move forward.</b>

07:55.220 --> 07:56.950
<b>You taught me how.</b>

07:56.950 --> 07:58.290
<b>I...</b>

07:58.290 --> 08:00.080
<b>I d-didn't do...</b>

08:00.850 --> 08:04.840
<b>But still... I'm a little glad.</b>

08:04.840 --> 08:09.100
<b>Because I love those words, too...</b>

08:09.860 --> 08:13.640
<b>I guess that was the part of you
I fell for.</b>

08:17.830 --> 08:21.320
<b>B-But before you said
you didn't like me at all!</b>

08:21.320 --> 08:24.320
<b>That was... How can I put it...</b>

08:24.320 --> 08:25.310
<b>I was embarrassed.</b>

08:25.310 --> 08:26.560
<b>I don't get it at all!</b>

08:26.560 --> 08:28.480
<b>Why?! Figure it out!</b>

08:28.480 --> 08:29.360
<b>I don't get it!</b>

08:33.220 --> 08:36.040
<b>Fine. Then I'll say it again.</b>

08:37.310 --> 08:39.370
<b>I'm grateful to you.</b>

08:40.640 --> 08:41.700
<b>You're precious to me.</b>

08:52.780 --> 08:55.220
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

08:56.120 --> 08:57.440
<b>But...</b>

08:57.440 --> 08:58.680
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

08:59.910 --> 09:01.480
<b>I too...</b>

09:01.480 --> 09:04.020
<b>have someone precious to me now.</b>

09:05.590 --> 09:07.150
<b>I see.</b>

09:07.460 --> 09:10.900
<b>It's nice you have someone
you can say that about.</b>

09:10.900 --> 09:12.410
<b>Yes.</b>

09:17.850 --> 09:18.740
<b>Suletta!</b>

09:18.740 --> 09:20.040
<b>Ms. Miorine!</b>

09:20.040 --> 09:23.040
<b>Th-This is, uh... not what it--</b>

09:21.840 --> 09:23.040
<b>I've decided...</b>

09:23.040 --> 09:24.540
<b>what I want for my birthday.</b>

09:25.810 --> 09:27.870
<b>A duel between you and Guel.</b>

09:27.870 --> 09:30.000
<b>Give me the gift of victory.</b>

09:31.280 --> 09:32.200
<b>What?!</b>

09:31.280 --> 09:32.200
<b>What?!</b>

09:32.880 --> 09:34.170
<b>What's the big idea?</b>

09:34.170 --> 09:35.970
<b>Explain yourself, Miorine!</b>

09:36.780 --> 09:38.270
<b>I...</b>

09:38.270 --> 09:40.270
<b>am finished with dueling.</b>

09:40.270 --> 09:41.510
<b>I have a proposal.</b>

09:42.960 --> 09:46.360
<b>I'm going to run
for president of the Benerit Group.</b>

09:46.360 --> 09:49.150
<b>I want you and the Jeturk company
to support me.</b>

09:49.150 --> 09:51.200
<b>Wait a second! Where is this going?</b>

09:51.200 --> 09:52.410
<b>Your company...</b>

09:52.410 --> 09:54.480
<b>You want to rebuild it, right?</b>

09:54.900 --> 09:57.250
<b>I'll become your fiancée.</b>

09:57.250 --> 10:02.130
<b>If that happens, the Group is sure
to fully support the Jeturk company.</b>

10:03.350 --> 10:06.090
<b>So you're telling me to win the duel?</b>

10:06.900 --> 10:08.370
<b>I'm the same as you.</b>

10:09.270 --> 10:11.340
<b>I don't want to lose them...</b>

10:11.780 --> 10:13.340
<b>The things precious to me.</b>

10:14.280 --> 10:16.840
<b>Please, Guel Jeturk.</b>

10:17.400 --> 10:19.010
<b>Reclaim your bride...</b>

10:19.780 --> 10:21.440
<b>from Suletta.</b>

10:23.480 --> 10:26.910
<b>Both parties, deposit
your souls on Libra's scales.</b>

10:27.980 --> 10:31.830
<b>The duelists
are Suletta Mercury and Guel Jeturk.</b>

10:31.830 --> 10:34.670
<b>The location will be
the 13th tactical testing sector.</b>

10:34.670 --> 10:36.380
<b>The one-on-one code will apply.</b>

10:36.380 --> 10:37.990
<b>Are there any objections?</b>

10:37.990 --> 10:38.900
<b>No.</b>

10:37.990 --> 10:38.900
<b>No.</b>

10:38.900 --> 10:42.160
<b>Well, sir... you haven't
quit school after all, huh?</b>

10:42.640 --> 10:45.830
<b>Would you like to extend
your record of losing like a dog?</b>

10:45.830 --> 10:48.350
<b>The Jeturk emblem is the lion.</b>

10:48.350 --> 10:50.480
<b>So call me a lion, not a dog.</b>

10:51.650 --> 10:53.160
<b>Suletta Mercury,</b>

10:53.160 --> 10:55.610
<b>what is your stake in this duel?</b>

10:55.610 --> 10:57.440
<b>Well, um...</b>

10:58.170 --> 11:02.680
<b>Will you help stop
the harassment of Earth House?</b>

11:02.680 --> 11:03.970
<b>Harassment?</b>

11:03.970 --> 11:06.280
<b>Ever since the Open Campus,</b>

11:06.280 --> 11:09.520
<b>everyone in Earth House
has been treated like a criminal.</b>

11:09.980 --> 11:13.880
<b>If the students from Jeturk House
would take our side...</b>

11:15.230 --> 11:16.270
<b>I'll agree.</b>

11:16.980 --> 11:18.380
<b>Guel Jeturk,</b>

11:18.380 --> 11:20.960
<b>what is your stake in this duel?</b>

11:21.440 --> 11:22.890
<b>If I win...</b>

11:24.060 --> 11:25.620
<b>Aerial will be mine.</b>

11:26.700 --> 11:28.810
<b>W-Wait a minute!</b>

11:28.810 --> 11:30.720
<b>What do you want with Aerial, Mr. Guel?</b>

11:30.720 --> 11:32.170
<b>Let him try.</b>

11:32.560 --> 11:33.640
<b>Ms. Miorine?</b>

11:33.640 --> 11:35.540
<b>If you win, it doesn't matter.</b>

11:36.330 --> 11:37.960
<b>You can do that, right?</b>

11:38.580 --> 11:39.760
<b>Yes...</b>

11:39.760 --> 11:41.900
<b><i>Alea jacta est.</i></b>

11:41.900 --> 11:43.740
<b>The duel is approved.</b>

11:47.400 --> 11:48.140
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

11:48.590 --> 11:49.780
<b>For what?</b>

11:49.780 --> 11:51.020
<b>About Suletta...</b>

11:51.470 --> 11:53.340
<b>you really did like her, didn't you?</b>

11:54.100 --> 11:57.110
<b>I told her how I feel. Plus...</b>

11:57.560 --> 11:59.770
<b>There are more important things right now.</b>

12:04.360 --> 12:06.180
<b>Speaking of her, is it true?</b>

12:06.180 --> 12:08.510
<b>What you said about her mother...</b>

12:08.510 --> 12:10.040
<b>It's true.</b>

12:10.740 --> 12:14.330
<b>Suletta doesn't question
anything her mother says.</b>

12:14.330 --> 12:19.300
<b>She was only sent to this school
to fight duels in Aerial.</b>

12:20.210 --> 12:23.030
<b>I want that girl to be happy.</b>

12:23.500 --> 12:27.410
<b>She needs a world where she can be
free from Gundams or anything else.</b>

12:28.260 --> 12:30.060
<b>There are no worlds like that.</b>

12:30.520 --> 12:31.280
<b>Huh?</b>

12:31.280 --> 12:32.990
<b>I have one thing to ask.</b>

12:32.990 --> 12:34.020
<b>What is it?</b>

12:34.760 --> 12:36.830
<b>Lend me some scissors and clippers.</b>

12:37.270 --> 12:39.520
<b>Are you really gonna duel like this?</b>

12:39.520 --> 12:41.500
<b>It can't be helped.</b>

12:41.500 --> 12:43.820
<b>It was confiscated during our suspension.</b>

12:43.820 --> 12:46.300
<b>And we have no money for repairs.</b>

12:46.300 --> 12:49.390
<b>Damn it! If only Nika were here!</b>

12:49.390 --> 12:52.720
<b>Now that you mention it,
Ms. Miorine's gone missing too.</b>

12:52.720 --> 12:56.180
<b>Sorry about this.
My work schedule was moved up.</b>

12:56.180 --> 12:57.880
<b>No... it's okay.</b>

12:59.100 --> 13:00.090
<b>Look at this!</b>

13:00.090 --> 13:03.480
<b>Ms. Miorine said it would
be a victory charm!</b>

13:03.480 --> 13:06.240
<b>Stay focused. I'm rooting for you.</b>

13:12.010 --> 13:13.560
<b>I've made the preparations.</b>

13:14.180 --> 13:17.790
<b>Don't you feel sorry for her?
She was rather fired up.</b>

13:17.790 --> 13:19.760
<b><i>I can't believe you're saying that.</i></b>

13:20.260 --> 13:22.440
<b>When the time comes,
I'll give you the signal.</b>

13:22.900 --> 13:24.920
<b><i>Please look forward to it.</i></b>

13:25.560 --> 13:27.070
<b>Mr. Guel?</b>

13:27.070 --> 13:28.840
<b>What happened to your hair?</b>

13:28.840 --> 13:31.950
<b>It was damaged anyway. You don't like it?</b>

13:32.470 --> 13:33.380
<b>Guel!</b>

13:34.240 --> 13:38.730
<b>I did my best to optimize it,
but what about that AI?</b>

13:38.730 --> 13:40.980
<b>I don't care. Leave it in.</b>

13:40.980 --> 13:42.130
<b>Are you sure?</b>

13:42.870 --> 13:46.590
<b>Pride alone won't defeat Suletta Mercury.</b>

13:46.590 --> 13:49.220
<b>Why didn't you tell me about this?</b>

13:49.220 --> 13:52.280
<b>Sorry. We couldn't find the right timing.</b>

13:52.280 --> 13:54.530
<b>And? How far have you gotten with him?</b>

13:56.330 --> 13:57.190
<b>Lauda...</b>

13:57.790 --> 13:59.190
<b>I'm sorry for everything.</b>

13:59.890 --> 14:01.890
<b>Why apologize?</b>

14:01.890 --> 14:04.940
<b>As your older brother,
I've never done a thing for you.</b>

14:05.600 --> 14:08.340
<b>You can still count on my support.</b>

14:09.230 --> 14:11.910
<b>Just like I told you when we first met.</b>

14:11.910 --> 14:14.740
<b>Connection established
with Carrier Gate No. 2.</b>

14:14.740 --> 14:16.040
<b>Whenever you're ready!</b>

14:16.040 --> 14:17.330
<b>Guel!</b>

14:17.330 --> 14:18.790
<b>Mr. Guel!</b>

14:19.290 --> 14:20.250
<b>Brother...</b>

14:23.960 --> 14:25.170
<b>I'm off.</b>

14:35.130 --> 14:37.910
<b><i>MS container is authorized to launch.</i></b>

14:39.300 --> 14:40.350
<b>Let me out!</b>

14:40.900 --> 14:44.220
<b><i>We will now begin the duel.</i></b>

14:44.220 --> 14:46.070
<b><i>As always, victory will go</i></b>

14:46.070 --> 14:49.820
<b><i>to the first one to break the blade
antenna of their opponent's mobile suit.</i></b>

14:49.820 --> 14:54.620
<b>The observer shall be me,
Secelia Dote of Burion House.</b>

14:54.620 --> 14:55.650
<b>A duel?</b>

14:55.650 --> 14:56.580
<b>They say it's the last one.</b>

14:56.580 --> 14:57.750
<b>It's Guel.</b>

14:57.750 --> 14:59.830
<b>It's about to start.
Aren't you gonna watch?</b>

14:59.830 --> 15:02.960
<b>I don't want to see any more fighting.</b>

15:02.960 --> 15:06.520
<b>He's just back home
and already so hot-blooded.</b>

15:06.870 --> 15:09.190
<b>Guel hasn't changed a bit.</b>

15:09.190 --> 15:11.680
<b>No, his objective must be...</b>

15:11.680 --> 15:13.800
<b>The restoration of the Jeturk company.</b>

15:13.800 --> 15:16.850
<b><i>Is this your doing, Miorine?</i></b>

15:18.550 --> 15:20.290
<b><i>No objects in vicinity!</i></b>

15:20.290 --> 15:22.580
<b><i>Unlocking MS containers!</i></b>

15:25.810 --> 15:28.650
<b><i>KP001, Guel Jeturk...</i></b>

15:29.310 --> 15:31.990
<b><i>LP041, Suletta Mercury...</i></b>

15:32.480 --> 15:33.490
<b>Darilbalde...</b>

15:33.490 --> 15:34.240
<b>Aerial...</b>

15:34.860 --> 15:35.660
<b><i>Moving out!</i></b>

15:34.860 --> 15:35.660
<b><i>Taking off!</i></b>

15:40.240 --> 15:43.060
<b>Aerial is back in action.</b>

15:43.060 --> 15:44.230
<b>Yes.</b>

15:44.230 --> 15:47.460
<b>Enhanced Person Number Five has failed.</b>

15:47.460 --> 15:49.770
<b>Why are you here?</b>

15:49.770 --> 15:51.910
<b>Don't be so rude.</b>

15:52.790 --> 15:53.720
<b>What's this?</b>

15:53.720 --> 15:55.510
<b>So you're here too, huh?</b>

15:56.080 --> 15:59.310
<b>They were worried about you...
your Earthian friends.</b>

16:00.300 --> 16:03.770
<b>It occurred to me during the Rumble Ring.</b>

16:04.200 --> 16:07.900
<b>"The Gundams and Grassley
must be in cahoots," I thought.</b>

16:07.900 --> 16:11.380
<b>And when I snooped around,
I was right on the money!</b>

16:11.380 --> 16:14.130
<b>I'm not welcome at Peil now.</b>

16:14.130 --> 16:16.870
<b>Since we're all fugitives,
let's be friends.</b>

16:17.570 --> 16:19.720
<b>No thank you.</b>

16:19.720 --> 16:22.620
<b>Why not get in a Gundam and die already?</b>

16:22.620 --> 16:25.190
<b>I'd like to live a long life.</b>

16:25.190 --> 16:29.000
<b>Being killed by you
or dying in a Gundam aren't in my plans.</b>

16:29.560 --> 16:32.160
<b>Dying... in a Gundam?</b>

16:32.630 --> 16:34.780
<b>Both parties, face off.</b>

16:35.250 --> 16:38.810
<b>Victory is never decided
by mobile suit performance, alone.</b>

16:38.810 --> 16:41.640
<b>Nor by the skill of the pilot, alone.</b>

16:41.640 --> 16:44.560
<b><i>The result itself is the only truth.</i></b>

16:41.640 --> 16:44.560
<b><i>The result itself is the only truth.</i></b>

16:42.600 --> 16:44.560
<b>13th Tactical Testing Sector</b>

16:44.560 --> 16:46.190
<b>Fix release.</b>

16:51.560 --> 16:52.170
<b><i>Brother!</i></b>

16:52.170 --> 16:53.400
<b>I know!</b>

16:53.400 --> 16:54.610
<b>First I have to close the range!</b>

17:02.910 --> 17:04.000
<b>A shield?</b>

17:04.870 --> 17:06.100
<b>Got you!</b>

17:11.000 --> 17:11.710
<b>Brother?</b>

17:14.290 --> 17:15.530
<b>Damn you...</b>

17:16.550 --> 17:18.510
<b>Is something wrong with Guel?</b>

17:18.510 --> 17:20.030
<b>Why won't he shoot?</b>

17:20.030 --> 17:21.660
<b>Heck if I know!</b>

17:22.010 --> 17:24.160
<b><i>What is it, Brother? Trouble of some kind?</i></b>

17:25.350 --> 17:28.770
<b>It's nothing.
I'll snap out of it right away.</b>

17:29.560 --> 17:32.730
<b>Delling's daughter... was pleased.</b>

17:33.260 --> 17:35.930
<b>Thank you, Bel.</b>

17:35.930 --> 17:37.070
<b>Not at all...</b>

17:38.900 --> 17:40.740
<b>Isn't Mr. Guel feeling well?</b>

17:41.340 --> 17:42.450
<b><i>Even so...</i></b>

17:47.200 --> 17:48.320
<b><i>Everyone!</i></b>

17:54.080 --> 17:55.530
<b>Mr. Guel!</b>

18:06.550 --> 18:08.080
<b>Go, Suletta!</b>

18:23.610 --> 18:25.120
<b>Brother!</b>

18:23.610 --> 18:25.120
<b>Mr. Guel!</b>

18:32.620 --> 18:34.020
<b><i>He blocked it?</i></b>

18:59.150 --> 19:00.420
<b>Wow!</b>

19:00.420 --> 19:01.820
<b>What was that move?!</b>

19:01.820 --> 19:03.130
<b>Mr. Guel!</b>

19:03.130 --> 19:04.580
<b>You can do it!</b>

19:06.740 --> 19:08.310
<b><i>Guel! Are you okay?</i></b>

19:10.530 --> 19:12.000
<b>This thing...</b>

19:12.000 --> 19:15.920
<b>Mr. Guel, you're as strong
as I thought. But...</b>

19:15.920 --> 19:17.520
<b>Aerial!</b>

19:22.960 --> 19:25.680
<b>What the... Override?!</b>

19:29.220 --> 19:29.980
<b>Brother!</b>

19:30.950 --> 19:32.520
<b><i>I promised.</i></b>

19:32.520 --> 19:34.360
<b>For Miorine's birthday...</b>

19:35.600 --> 19:36.810
<b><i>I promised I'd win!</i></b>

19:48.700 --> 19:51.080
<b><i>I said I'd stay at her side forever.</i></b>

19:51.640 --> 19:54.050
<b><i>Now it's my turn to ask her that.</i></b>

19:56.500 --> 19:59.520
<b><i>We'll buy rings together
and have a wedding.</i></b>

19:59.520 --> 20:01.590
<b><i>And we'll both wear the very best dresses!</i></b>

20:03.170 --> 20:04.760
<b><i>So...</i></b>

20:05.260 --> 20:06.550
<b><i>So...</i></b>

20:06.550 --> 20:09.030
<b>Please choose me!</b>

20:11.850 --> 20:13.600
<b><i>I'm sorry.</i></b>

20:22.730 --> 20:24.320
<b>Aerial?</b>

20:45.250 --> 20:46.680
<b>He won!</b>

20:45.250 --> 20:46.680
<b>He won!</b>

20:46.680 --> 20:48.640
<b>Yeah!</b>

20:49.170 --> 20:51.810
<b>I believed in you... Brother!</b>

20:52.800 --> 20:55.310
<b>Suletta... lost?</b>

20:55.900 --> 20:56.900
<b>It can't be true.</b>

21:04.310 --> 21:06.910
<b>What do I do, Aerial?</b>

21:07.610 --> 21:09.950
<b>Even though it's Ms. Miorine's birthday...</b>

21:10.320 --> 21:14.720
<b>Even though I promised I'd win...</b>

21:18.420 --> 21:19.540
<b>Ms. Miorine!</b>

21:19.870 --> 21:21.550
<b>Ms. Miorine?</b>

21:21.550 --> 21:24.460
<b>I'm so sorry! I... Aerial...</b>

21:24.460 --> 21:28.010
<b>She stopped moving all of a sudden, and...</b>

21:28.010 --> 21:28.970
<b>I know.</b>

21:30.620 --> 21:32.430
<b>Because it was me who did it.</b>

21:34.430 --> 21:36.120
<b>But... why?</b>

21:36.120 --> 21:37.850
<b>I wanted you to lose.</b>

21:40.710 --> 21:41.440
<b>That's a lie...</b>

21:41.970 --> 21:44.090
<b>I told you from the beginning, didn't I?</b>

21:44.090 --> 21:46.340
<b>This was a trade.</b>

21:46.340 --> 21:48.610
<b>You made a good shield.</b>

21:51.840 --> 21:55.680
<b>But then, you can't fulfill
your obligations if you lose.</b>

21:55.680 --> 21:56.820
<b>Wait!</b>

21:56.820 --> 21:58.290
<b>Please wait!</b>

21:58.290 --> 22:01.250
<b>Mr. Guel! Please duel with me again!</b>

22:01.250 --> 22:03.710
<b><i>Next time... I won't lose!</i></b>

22:03.710 --> 22:04.350
<b>So--</b>

22:04.350 --> 22:05.980
<b>I'll take that back too.</b>

22:08.670 --> 22:11.010
<b>Thanks for all your hard work.</b>

22:15.760 --> 22:17.190
<b>Goodbye,</b>

22:18.230 --> 22:20.270
<b>my Mercurian country bumpkin.</b>

23:53.970 --> 24:02.000
<b>Episode 18</b>

23:54.320 --> 23:57.890
<b><i>Next time on</i>
Mobile Suit Gundam the Witch from Mercury,</b>

23:58.290 --> 23:59.850
<b><i>"Our Empty Selves."</i></b>

24:02.000 --> 24:07.250
<b>Illustration: Takuji Kato</b>
